OL,3,AControversial Drumcree Orange Order
OL,4,Amarch to go ahead for first time since
OL,5,A1997
OL,6,
OL,7,FA controversial Orange Order parade is
OL,8,Fdue to go down the mainly nationalist
OL,9,FGarvaghy Road later this morning for
OL,10,Fthe first time in almost 30 years
OL,12,FIt comes after 24 hours of legal drama
OL,13,Fthat went into the early hours of
OL,14,FSunday, with the High Court ruling that
OL,15,Fan initial decision to allow the march
OL,16,Fto take place had to be respected
OL,18,FThe Parades Commission had ruled on
OL,19,FFriday that the march can go ahead, but
OL,20,Fwith 35 participants and no bands
OL,21,Ftaking part
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/40
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
