OL,3,AControversial Drumcree Orange Order
OL,4,Amarch to go ahead for first time since
OL,5,A1997
OL,6,
OL,7,FA dispute over the march in the 1990s
OL,8,Fsparked some of the most serious
OL,9,Fdisorder in Northern Ireland's history,
OL,10,Fand led to the formation of the Parades
OL,11,FCommission to adjudicate on
OL,12,Fcontroversial marches
OL,14,FThe Orange Order, the most prominent of
OL,15,Fthe loyal orders associated with
OL,16,FProtestants in Northern Ireland, say
OL,17,Fthe Garvaghy Road is part of its
OL,18,Ftraditional marching route but the
OL,19,Fevent is opposed by many residents who
OL,20,Flive on the road
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/40
