OL,3,ABurnham announces scheme to help
OL,4,Afirst-time buyers on to housing ladder
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham is to
OL,7,Fintroduce a new scheme to try to help
OL,8,Fpeople "who have given up hope of ever
OL,9,Fhaving a home to call their own" get on
OL,10,Fthe property ladder.
OL,12,FThe "Your First Home" scheme would be
OL,13,Fopen to first-time buyers in England
OL,14,Fwith a deposit of 2.5%. It would
OL,15,Fprovide them with a loan worth 20% of
OL,16,Ftheir new build property's value to
OL,17,Fhelp pay for the purchase.
OL,19,FOn Sunday, the government also shared
OL,20,Fplans it said would make it simpler for
OL,21,Fcouncils to take over empty homes to
OL,22,Fprovide housing for those in need.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/40
