OL,3,AChrista Pike to be first woman executed
OL,4,Ain Tennessee in 200 years - but her
OL,5,Adefence say she's a victim too
OL,6,
OL,7,FAshlee Sellars last heard from her
OL,8,Ffriend Christa Pike earlier this week,
OL,9,Fwhen Pike texted her from her cell on
OL,10,Fdeath row as she prepares to be killed
OL,11,Fby lethal injection by the US state of
OL,12,FTennessee.
OL,14,FPike told Sellars she does not want any
OL,15,Fof her loved ones to be present on
OL,16,FWednesday when she is executed.
OL,18,F"She doesn't want us to experience
OL,19,Fthat," Sellars says.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/40
